# A page opened during deployment can still reference the previous locale
# bundle. Existing hashed files shadow this unforced rewrite; missing bundles
# use the complete runtime without changing script order or refreshing the page.
# Match one segment only so unrelated/nested missing assets remain 404s.
# This also covers the app pages' runtime loader, which lives beside the bundles.
/assets/i18n/:bundle                 /i18n.js                 200
# The same holds for the app pages' page-copy loader and language catalogs:
# a missing one is served the complete all-language catalog instead.
/assets/page-i18n/:bundle            /page-i18n.js            200

