# The build appends exact rewrites for shared assets and noindex app pages.
# Never restore /:lang/* -> /:splat: it serves duplicate content at nested
# locale URLs and hides missing translations behind Turkish public pages.
# Existing locale index files handle their own trailing slash. A forced
# /en -> /en/ rule also matches /en/ on Netlify and redirects to itself.
